{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/pulls/1","id":4040018165,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTVpH887wzcj1","html_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/pull/1","diff_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/pull/1.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/flowercomputers/bogkit/pull/1.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/issues/1","number":1,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Area denial: a location-based team game built on fold","user":{"login":"rcrdlbl","id":40729534,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzI5NTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40729534?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl","html_url":"https://github.com/rcrdlbl","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rcrdlbl/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n- Adds `mmo-cs`, a location-based \"area denial\" team game (spec in `project-idea.md`): two teams stream GPS location from the browser, and fold maintains a live per-team scoreboard (roster size, in-bounds presence) over a websocket, following `examples/chat`'s ingest-thread/watch-channel architecture.\n- Win conditions: instant elimination when a team is confirmed swept from the battleground (debounced against flaky GPS), or a 3-hour timeout decided by in-bounds percentage with a headcount tiebreak.\n- Battleground catalog is a curated extract of real Brooklyn/Queens parks from NYC Open Data's public \"Parks Properties\" dataset (Foursquare's OS Places dataset, named in the original spec, now requires a gated Hugging Face account/token).\n- `fold::pipeline::Keyed<K, V>` now derives `Serialize`/`Deserialize`, needed for `Retain` to wrap a `KeyedStream`'s root `Keyed` type directly.\n- Adds a top-level `CLAUDE.md` documenting the workspace's architecture and commands for future Claude Code sessions.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `cargo build --workspace` and `cargo test --workspace` pass, including `fold`'s existing unit/doc tests (verifies the `Keyed` derive change is non-breaking)\n- [x] `cargo clippy -p mmo-cs --all-targets` clean\n- [x] Scripted websocket client exercising the full flow: join both teams, `start_battle` gating on both rosters ≥1, geofencing via bbox containment, `Retain`'s liveness TTL expiring a stale ping mid-battle, the elimination debounce, and the timeout/headcount tiebreak (via `MMO_BATTLE_DURATION_SECS` for a short test run)\n- [ ] Manual test with real phones/GPS in an actual park\n- [ ] Public HTTPS deployment (needed for browser Geolocation off localhost)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-07-12T19:21:21Z","updated_at":"2026-07-12T20:11:32Z","closed_at":"2026-07-12T20:11:32Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"d7d787f551b9ba44440c7f2d7d51a3363d61200a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/pulls/1/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/pulls/1/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/issues/1/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/flowercomputers/bogkit/statuses/99a98fa26b61bd2e92e8224c102246b370438690","head":{